<title>POLAND: Polish Mieszko up 53.8 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Polish Mieszko up 53.8 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish confectioner Mieszko SA started trading on the parallel market of the Warsaw bourse at 20 zlotys, 53.8 percent higher than its April 1.5-million-share public offering price of 13 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
